cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pain001-lsp in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pain001-lsp: language server for ISO 20022 payment data files"
abstract: >-
  A Language Server Protocol implementation for the pain001 library:
  diagnostics, completions, hover, quick fixes, formatting and document
  symbols for ISO 20022 pain.001 payment data files, plus commands that
  reach the validated example corpus.
authors:
